# Per-machine cabal override: `make` writes the rusty-slap link path here
# (extra-lib-dirs, derived from the checkout location) so every cabal
# invocation -- not just make -- can link rusty_slap. Regenerated when the
# path changes; never committed.
cabal.project.local

